# Whitelist: the build context holds only code. Sample sheets, clinical data,
# reference DBs, results and secrets must never reach the image.
*
!pixi.toml
!pixi.lock
!workflow/
!config/config.yaml
!docker/
# re-exclude anything that could appear inside whitelisted dirs
**/samples*.tsv
**/.env
**/*.dta
**/*.xlsx
**/*.RData
**/__pycache__
workflow/notebooks/
